    "info": "Builds the MQTT message for the `text` command of the ledder **MQTT** animation\n(`ledder/animations/Remote/MQTT.ts`). Connect the output to an *mqtt out* node.\n\n### Inputs\n: payload (string) : the text to show. `\\n` starts a new line. Empty removes the text.\n: remove (boolean) : `true` removes the text with this id.\n: removeAll (boolean) : `true` removes all texts, of every id.\n: *any property* : `msg.x`, `msg.color`, `msg.textId`, ... override the property of this node.\n\n### Outputs\n: topic (string) : `<MQTT topic>/text/<Text id>`\n: payload (string) : the DrawText parameters as JSON, or empty to remove the text.\n\nUse a different *Text id* per text: the same id replaces (or removes) the text that was shown with it.",
